# Auction Arena — Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values you have.

```env
# ── Server
PORT=3000
HOST=0.0.0.0

# ── Stats providers
# TheSportsDB — public key 123 works without registration (profile data for both sports).
# Leave empty to use the built-in public key.
SPORTSDB_KEY=

# API-Football (api-football.com) — free 100 req/day.
# Provides full career stats for football players.
# Get key at: https://dashboard.api-football.com/
APIFOOTBALL_KEY=

# CricAPI (cricapi.com) — free tier.
# Provides full career stats for cricket players.
# Get key at: https://www.cricapi.com/
CRICAPI_KEY=

# Alias for CRICAPI_KEY (either works)
# CRICKETDATA_KEY=

# ── Tests
TEST_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3000
```

## Notes

* If no API keys are configured, the server uses a **mock fallback** that generates
  plausible-looking stats from each player's built-in `rating`. The game is fully
  playable without any external API.

* **Do NOT commit `.env` to git.** It is already in `.gitignore`.

* Check provider health at any time: `GET /api/stats/status`

* Debug a single player: `GET /api/stats/diagnose?name=Virat+Kohli&sport=cricket`
